return {
    ["   <Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161_R\">……</>我有一种预感，今晚会有大事发生。不过多亏了我买的那些宝贝，还有我可爱的灵蛇灵鼠们，现在我与其说是害怕，不如说特别兴奋，就好像，有人会帮我解决这些事一样……命运不都是这样的吗？越过一个生死难关，然后晋升到下一个序列……\n\n  而且，门窗、香料，仪式用品，我都已经做好了准备，还有“那个东西”也放在了床边。写完这篇后，我将去等待那个时刻。等“它”真的来了的时候，我也不会害怕……嗯，我不应该害怕，我的封印物，我的宠物，我自己……可以做到的！"] = " <Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161_R\">...</>I have a premonition that something big will happen tonight. However, thanks to the treasures I bought, and my lovely spirit snakes and spirit rats, now, rather than being afraid, I am particularly excited, as if someone will help me solve these things... Isn't fate always like this? Overcoming a life-and-death crisis, and then advancing to the next Sequence... \n\n And, the doors and windows, incense, and ritual supplies, I have already prepared everything, and \"that thing\" is also placed by the bed. After finishing this entry, I will go and wait for that moment. When \"it\" really comes, I won't be afraid... Hmm, I shouldn't be afraid, my Sealed Artifact, my pets, myself... I can do it!",
