    ["　　一想到你要独自去那种地方，我就忍不住担忧你的安危。但我又与你一样好奇：他们真的和我们一样吗？无论是外表，还是内心？\n此次调查无疑是一项艰巨的任务，路途凶险，还请你务必保重。\n　　如果那里能收到来信，希望你能抽空报个平安。小玛莎和我一直期待着去廷根火车站接你回家的那天！\n　　愿女神庇佑你的归途平安无阻！"] = "Thinking that you have to go to such a place alone, I can't help but worry about your safety. But I am just as curious as you: are they really the same as us? Both in appearance and in heart? \n This investigation is undoubtedly a difficult task, and the journey is dangerous, so please take care. \n If you can receive letters there, I hope you can find time to report that you are safe. Little Martha and I are looking forward to the day we go to Tingen Train Station to pick you up! \n May the Goddess protect your return journey safely!",
